tude, it's my secret hide."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So if you too want to unwind,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Just let go and leave it all behind."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Join me in the lazy attitude, we'll be kings,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And we'll sing together our joyful spring."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}